   procedure Traverse
     (Self : in out Visitor'Class;
      Root : Node_Access);
   --  Visit a node subtree.  A null root performs no callbacks.

   --  Enter callbacks begin with Continue_Traversal.  They may choose
   --  Skip_Children to omit that message's descendants while retaining
   --  its matching Leave callback, or Stop_Traversal to end immediately.
   --  Exceptions from callbacks propagate and do not promise balanced
   --  Leave callbacks.  Traversal is read-only and does not take ownership.

